    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your damaging cantrips affect even creatures that avoid the brunt of the effect. When you cast a cantrip at a creature and you miss with the attack roll or the target succeeds on a saving throw against the cantrip, the target takes half the cantrip’s damage (if any) but suffers no additional effect from the cantrip.</p><section id=\"secret-fJby40y1vz8RXGG4\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>With their token selected you can either right click on the damage roll's chat card and select <span class=\"reference\"><em class=\"fas fa-user-shield\"> </em>Apply Half Damage</span> or click the \"1/2\" button and then the <span class=\"reference\"><em class=\"fa-solid fa-reply-all\"> </em>Apply</span> button.</p></section>",
